---
// src/pages/index.astro
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<PageLayout
  title={`${site.name} — ${site.role}`}
  description={site.description}
  active="home"
  heading="About"
>
  <section class="max-w-[46rem]">
    <p class="text-ink leading-[1.75] text-base">
      I am the founder of <strong>Engram</strong>. Previously, I worked as a researcher at the MIT Media
      Lab and as an AI Engineer at Millennium. I study Joint Mathematics and Computer Science at
      Imperial College London.
    </p>
    <p class="text-ink leading-[1.75] text-base mt-4">
      My interests span <em>Computer Vision</em>, <em>Embodied Intelligence</em>, <em>Agentic Frameworks</em>,
      and <em>Quantitative Trading</em>. My research has focused on 4D perception, vision-language-action
      interpretability, and active vision, while my industry work has centered on AI agents for equity
      research. At Engram, we are exploring digital twins, agent-to-agent (A2A) systems, and new models
      for robot distribution.
    </p>
    <p class="text-ink leading-[1.75] text-base mt-4">
      I write about this new AI era: how intelligence is moving from models into institutions and the
      physical world, how it may reshape finance and knowledge work, and what should remain distinctly
      human. As a founder, I want to build for the long term, pursuing ideas that are technically
      ambitious, useful in the real world, and durable beyond the current cycle.
    </p>
    <a
      href="/blog/"
      class="mt-5 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center border-b border-accent font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-accent focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-accent focus-visible:outline-offset-4"
    >
      Read my essays
    </a>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
